    "在使用同一 Apple 账户的 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 间同步聊天、附件、模型服务配置、默认模型、Soul、Memory、Skills 和外观。API Key、设备权限和 Alpine 环境保留在各设备；新设备需重新填写 API Key。任务或设置编辑完成后再同步。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "generatesSymbol" : false,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sync chats, attachments, provider settings, preferred model, Soul, Memory, Skills and appearance across iPhone, iPad and Mac using the same Apple Account. API keys, device permissions and the Alpine environment stay on each device; enter API keys again on a new device. Sync resumes after tasks and settings edits finish."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在使用同一 Apple 账户的 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 间同步聊天、附件、模型服务配置、默认模型、Soul、Memory、Skills 和外观。API Key、设备权限和 Alpine 环境保留在各设备；新设备需重新填写 API Key。任务或设置编辑完成后再同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
